# SHO App — Student Happiness Officer Platform

A full-stack education management platform built for HACA (Happily A Career Academy). It gives admins, mentors, SHOs (Student Happiness Officers), and academic leads a single workspace to manage batches, students, attendance, assignments, feedback, and curriculum planning.

