## Overview

SHO App is a role-gated management system for a vocational training academy. It handles the full student lifecycle — from enrolment and daily attendance to assignment submission, performance feedback, curriculum tracking, and automated reporting.

**Two databases run in parallel:**
- **MongoDB** (primary) — stores all transactional data (users, batches, students, attendance, etc.)
- **Supabase (PostgreSQL)** — mirrors student/batch data synced hourly via a background cron job

