## Features

### Dashboard
Role-aware overview showing key metrics: active batches, total students, average attendance, assignment completion rate. Mentors and SHOs see only their assigned batches. Includes a Class Planner progress widget showing curriculum completion per batch.

### Batch Management
Create and manage training batches with school assignment, SHO/SSHO/Mentor staff assignment, start/end dates, mode (Online/Offline), capacity tracking, and course type. Batch detail page shows all students, attendance logs, assignments, and class planner sessions.

### Student Management
Full student profiles including personal details, parent/guardian contact, career goals, qualification, and status (`active`, `placed`, `interview_required`, `revoked`). Includes co-curriculum activity tracking (presentations, mock interviews, personality development) and performance summaries. Import students in bulk via CSV or sync from Supabase.

### Attendance
SHO-exclusive feature. Mark daily attendance for entire batches with per-student status (`present`, `absent`, `late`, `excused`) and remarks. Attendance analytics show trends, percentage by batch, and cross-batch comparisons.

### Class Planner & Curriculum
Two-layer curriculum system:
1. **Curriculum Templates** — reusable day-by-day course blueprints (e.g. "Data Analytics 60-day plan") stored per course type
2. **Class Logs** — batch-specific session instances with status (`planned`, `completed`, `skipped`), conducted date, and notes

Import curriculum directly from a Google Sheets URL. The backend fetches the sheet, parses CSV, auto-detects column names via fuzzy matching (handles "Topic", "Class Name", "What", "Subject", etc.), and normalises session types. Admins and mentors can also edit session details inline.

Session types supported: `regular`, `test`, `project`, `hr`, `placement`, `practice`.

### Assignments & Projects
Create assignments for batches or individual students with due dates, total marks, and file attachments. Students submit work and get graded with score and feedback. Separate Projects module for capstone/group projects.

### Feedback
Multi-type feedback system:
- **Student feedback** — per-student ratings (overall, communication, punctuality, understanding, participation) with strengths and improvement areas
- **Session feedback** — topic/date-linked session evaluations
- **Batch feedback** — cohort-level observations
- **Google Form links** — embed external feedback forms

### Module Exams
Track module-level exam results per student with scores, grade, and remarks.

### Notifications
Send targeted notifications to all students, specific batches, or individual students. Priority levels: low, medium, high, urgent. Supports file attachments. Role-based inbox for staff.

### Analytics
Visual dashboards with charts (Recharts) showing:
- Attendance trends over time
- Assignment completion rates by batch
- Feedback score distributions
- Student status breakdown (active/placed/interview required)
- Cross-batch performance comparisons

### Reports & Auto Reports
Generate on-demand reports or schedule automatic reports:
- **Weekly** — auto-sent every Monday at 8:00 AM
- **Monthly** — auto-sent on 1st of every month at 8:00 AM
- Reports delivered via email using configurable templates (Resend)

### Audit Logs
Every write operation (POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE) through `/api/*` is automatically logged with: user ID, name, role, action, target resource, IP address, device/user-agent, and timestamp. Viewable by admin and leadership roles only.

### AI ChatBot
Floating assistant powered by Google Gemini and/or Groq. Context-aware responses about the platform. Usage tracked per user via `ChatUsage` model.

### Support Inbox
Students and staff can submit support tickets (`ContactAdmin` public page). Admins view and manage tickets in the Support Inbox.

### System Storage & Sync
- View MongoDB collection sizes and document counts
- Manual trigger for Supabase → MongoDB data sync
- Automatic sync on startup + every hour via cron

