## Background Jobs

All scheduled tasks run inside the server process via `node-cron`:

| Job | Schedule | Description |
|---|---|---|
| Supabase → MongoDB sync | Startup + every hour (`0 * * * *`) | Mirrors student and batch data from Supabase |
| Weekly auto-reports | Every Monday 8:00 AM (`0 8 * * 1`) | Generates and emails weekly reports |
| Monthly auto-reports | 1st of month 8:00 AM (`0 8 1 * *`) | Generates and emails monthly reports |
| Batch start reminders | Daily 9:00 AM IST / 3:30 AM UTC (`30 3 * * *`) | Emails SHO/SSHO/mentors 5 days before a batch starts |

