## Deployment

### Frontend — Vercel

The [app/vercel.json](app/vercel.json) rewrites all routes to `index.html` for SPA routing. Connect the `app/` directory as the Vercel project root.

```bash
cd app
npm run build          # outputs to app/dist/
```

Vite splits vendor code into separate cached chunks (Recharts, Radix UI, Lucide, PDF.js) for optimal browser caching.

### Backend — Render / Railway / VPS

```bash
cd server
npm start              # node server.js
```

Set `MONGODB_URI` to your Atlas connection string and `FRONTEND_URL` to your Vercel deployment URL in the hosting platform's environment variables.

CORS is configured to allow:
- `localhost:3000`, `localhost:5173` (dev)
- Any `*.vercel.app` domain (Vercel previews)
- Any `*.ngrok-free.app` or `*.ngrok.io` domain (local tunnels)
- The explicit `FRONTEND_URL` env var

