## Development Notes

- **API client** — all frontend API calls go through [app/src/services/api.ts](app/src/services/api.ts) which attaches the JWT from localStorage automatically
- **Lazy loading** — every page component is code-split via `React.lazy()`. First visit downloads ~50-100 KB per page; subsequent visits are instant from the browser cache
- **Audit trail** — the `auditLogger` middleware runs after every `POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE` on `/api/*` and writes a log entry automatically — no manual logging required in route handlers
- **Google Sheets import** — tries `gviz` CSV URL first (works for "Anyone with link" shares), falls back to `export?format=csv`. Column names are fuzzy-matched so sheets with non-standard headers still parse correctly
